00:04:38,560 --> 00:04:43,560
What does it mean when you have an increase in bilirubin?

00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:48,560
So, bilirubin is a,

00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:54,540
shows a function of your liver really.

00:04:54,540 --> 00:04:59,540
So, bilirubin is, when you get your bilirubin measured in your blood,

00:04:59,540 --> 00:05:03,540
if you could have a total bilirubin

00:05:03,540 --> 00:05:06,540
or you could have an indirect bilirubin.

00:05:06,540 --> 00:05:12,540
So, typically your total bilirubin is composed of,

00:05:12,540 --> 00:05:15,540
what's called your indirect bilirubin.

00:05:15,540 --> 00:05:20,540
Your indirect bilirubin is also called your un-pagigated bilirubin.

00:05:20,540 --> 00:05:26,540
And that circulates in your blood on the way to the liver.

00:05:26,540 --> 00:05:31,540
And then you have direct or conjugated bilirubin.

00:05:31,540 --> 00:05:36,540
And that is when your liver makes the bilirubin water soluble

00:05:36,540 --> 00:05:41,540
to be deposited into the bile to be then go through the bile duct

00:05:41,540 --> 00:05:45,540
and the bile bladder and in the, in the small intestine.

00:05:45,540 --> 00:05:53,540
Remember, your bile is what brings all the toxins from your liver

00:05:53,540 --> 00:05:56,540
down into your small intestine as well.

00:05:56,540 --> 00:06:01,540
And then your bile also contains lipase to help break down fats.

00:06:01,540 --> 00:06:06,540
So, but bilirubin is the breakdown of hemoglobin.

00:06:06,540 --> 00:06:09,540
So, when you have an increased bilirubin,

00:06:09,540 --> 00:06:13,540
it can be because you have a breakdown in hemoglobin.

00:06:13,540 --> 00:06:19,540
So, you could have a breakdown in the blood disorder

00:06:19,540 --> 00:06:21,540
where you have what's called hemolysis,

00:06:21,540 --> 00:06:26,540
where you have a breakdown in red blood cells in the blood.

00:06:26,540 --> 00:06:29,540
That's less common.

00:06:29,540 --> 00:06:33,540
Most of the time, when you see an increase in bilirubin,

00:06:33,540 --> 00:06:37,540
it's because of a blockage of the bile duct.

00:06:37,540 --> 00:06:41,540
So, remember, your bilirubin will ultimately go through the liver

00:06:41,540 --> 00:06:47,540
and become made water soluble in the liver and then go through in the bile

00:06:47,540 --> 00:06:49,540
to the small intestine.

00:06:49,540 --> 00:06:53,540
That is the most common, especially for a person who has cancer,

00:06:53,540 --> 00:06:57,540
but a person has increased bilirubin, you're concerned with a blocked bile duct.

00:06:57,540 --> 00:07:02,540
Now, you could have a blocked bile duct for multiple reasons

00:07:02,540 --> 00:07:04,540
with a diagnosed cancer.

00:07:04,540 --> 00:07:07,540
You're concerned with metastasis to the liver

00:07:07,540 --> 00:07:11,540
